# Separate git repos that used to be checked out here. Both deleted from Tower
# on 2026-08-22 (RAI-9); these entries stay so neither comes back by accident.
#
# openclaw/ was an upstream vendor checkout of openclaw/openclaw pinned at
# 2026.2.6-3 (9f703a44). It was committed as a bare gitlink (mode 160000) with
# no .gitmodules entry, so every fresh clone got an empty, unresolvable
# openclaw/ directory. De-registered 2026-08-22. Nothing in this stack read it
# — the gateway is RainnWorks/clawmander, not upstream openclaw. Recoverable
# with a normal clone of openclaw/openclaw at 9f703a44.
#
# nanoclaw/ was a second checkout of RainnWorks/clawmander under its old name.
# Its HEAD b8d6797 is a strict ancestor of clawmander main, so it held no
# unique commits. It did hold 40 gitignored files under data/tools/ that had
# never reached any remote; those were pushed first, to
# RainnWorks/clawmander branch rescue/nanoclaw-data-tools-2026-08-22.
# The live checkout is HQ/clawmander.
nanoclaw/
openclaw/

# Served content, not source. Caddy mounts /Playground straight off this
# directory, but what lands here is BUILD OUTPUT published by
# nairn-book/bin/publish.sh — the book, the 22 spread JPEGs, the 113 MB of 4K
# print plates and the presenter's script. 71 MB, regenerable, and this repo is
# public while the book is a private family surprise. The source of record is
# Inlustra/nairn-book (private).
Playground/

